# Vision Pi image versions — production (main branch)
# Managed automatically by CI (L-Build Single Service workflow)
# Each var holds the exact Docker tag suffix for that service
# After build: SERVICE_TAG=latest-{gitsha}  (immutable, specific to that commit)
# Initial/fallback: SERVICE_TAG=latest       (mutable, always points to last build)

